<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG Metals Jan-Sept copper output rises.</title>
<headline>LG Metals Jan-Sept copper output rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG Metals Corp, a unit of South Korea's LG Group, said on Thursday its copper production rose 5.6 percent to 183,413 tonnes in the first nine months of this year against 173,610 tonnes a year earlier.  </p>
<p>An LG Metals official said the company produced 51.3 tonnes of gold in the nine months, up 49.6 percent from 34.3 tonnes a year ago, and 159 tonnes of silver, down 17.1 percent from 191.7 tonnes.</p>
<p>In 1995, LG Metals's output totalled 233,300 tonnes of copper, 40.69 tonnes of gold and 232 tonnes of silver.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
